  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_quartz",
      "name": {
        "en": "Quartz's Badge",
        "zh": "石英证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_quartz",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Quartz has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for wielding heavy melee weapons in combat.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Crusher responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员石英擅长使用沉重有力的武器迎击敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使重剑手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_quartz",
      "name": {
        "en": "Watchmaker's Kit",
        "zh": "钟表修理套组",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_quartz",
      "description": {
        "en": "'So, what's the plan?'\n'Simple: we go into the bar, find our target, and make him tell us where the Originium powder stash is.'\n'And the precise timing?' The young girl, having just finished cooking, leans against a pillar in the cellar, carefully wiping down her oversized greatsword.\n'Just a powder dealer. Untrained. Don't worry. It'll be a cakewalk.'\n'I told you, give me an exact time. That's how every mission should be handled. Or do you plan to come back hungry with no dinner ready?'\n'Alright, fine. He'll be there at 7:00 p.m., to meet someone else.'\nQuartz finishes cleaning her greatsword and opens a toolkit she'd bought from the town's clockmaker, then starts repairing the pocket watch she'd left on the dining table.\n'Thirteen seconds slow,' she says with a sigh.\nThat evening.\nCarrying her greatsword, Quartz pushes open the bar's doors.\nIn the only place in town worthy of being called entertainment, people were lost in wild revelry. Through the haze of alcohol vapors and clouds of smoke, she spots the target—crouched in the corner, clutching his glass tightly.\nShe steps over the drunk patrons sprawled on the floor and sits across from him.\n'Miss, can I get you a drink?'\n'No, thank you. I'm here waiting for someone—7:00, right?'\nThe target stares intently at her, this strange woman who had unexpectedly started talking to him. Swallowing hard, he suddenly pulls a remote from his bag and shouts:\n'You vermin couldn't make it in a nomadic city! And now you're out here in the wasteland, to make my life as miserable as yours! The moment the clock hits 7:00, the Originium powder bomb under this table will blow you sky-high! This is what mercs like you deserve!'\nSeven...\nThe music cuts off abruptly. The revelers freeze in their tracks, turning to look beneath the table where a blurred red countdown clock was flashing.\nSix...\nThe bar's doors fly open, followed by the windows, as those who are still sober drag their unconscious companions out of the building.\n'One!' The target shouts, jumping onto the bar and raising his arms as if welcoming a grand finale.\n'Sir, your watch is ten seconds fast.'\nQuartz lets out a long sigh, raises her greatsword, and brings it down on him.\nPeople watch as a young woman carrying a greatsword hauls a man out of the now-empty bar.\nFive seconds later, the bar explodes, sending wood and glass shards soaring, and bursting into a dazzling firework against the night sky.\n'Where are you going?'\n'To find some cold water to wake him up. Then, to thank my watch repair toolkit.'",
        "zh": "“所以，计划是什么？”\n“计划就是我们进入酒吧，找到我们的目标，然后让他把那批源石制粉的下落交代出来。”\n“具体时间呢？”发问的少女刚刚做完饭，靠在地窖的柱子上轻轻擦拭着那把并不称手的巨剑。\n“他就是个包拎久了手都会抖的源石制粉贩子而已，别那么上心。”\n“我说了，给我一个明确的时间，任何任务都应当是这样。还是说你们回来以后想饿着肚子没饭吃？”\n“好吧。晚上七点整，他会在那里与人接头。”\n擦拭完巨剑的石英打开了她从镇上钟表铺买来的维修工具，保养起她放在餐桌上的那枚怀表。\n“唉，慢了十三秒。”她发出了一声叹息。\n晚上。\n背负着巨剑的石英推开了酒吧的大门。\n人们在这小镇上唯一称得上娱乐场所的地方纵情狂欢。透过挥发的酒精与人们吐出的烟雾，她看到了目标——他正蜷缩在角落里，用力捏着酒杯。\n她跨过倒在地上烂醉如泥的客人们，坐到了目标的对面。\n“这位女士，喝点什么？”\n“谢谢，不需要，我是来等人的——七点，对吧？”\n目标死死地盯着突然向他搭话的石英，咽了咽口水，猛然从包中掏出了一个遥控器，高声大喊起来：\n“你这种在移动城市里活不下去的苍蝇！现在来荒地逼得我活不下去了！只要一到七点，装在这个桌子下面的源石制粉炸弹就会把你炸上天！这就是你当佣兵应得的！”\n七……\n音乐戛然而止，迷醉的人们猛地停下了自己的动作，他们看向桌子下方，一个模糊的红色数字正在闪动。\n六……\n酒吧的大门被冲开，然后是窗户，还没醉的人们忙着把已经不省人事的同伴拖出屋子。\n“一！”目标高喊着，跳上吧台高举双手，似乎要迎接一场盛大的葬礼。\n“先生你知道吗，你的表快了十秒。”\n石英长叹一口气，举起巨剑对着目标砸了下去。\n\n人们看到一个背负着巨剑的少女架着一个人走出了早已空无一人的酒吧。\n五秒后，酒吧发生了爆炸，木头、玻璃渣从她的身后飞向天空，在夜空中炸出了一朵绚烂的烟花。\n“你要去哪里？”\n“去找点凉水把他弄醒，然后去感谢我的钟表维修工具。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
